{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/berkeley-place-ellington-properties-sobha-hartland","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":640,"crm_id":"921","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Berkeley Place","slug":"berkeley-place-ellington-properties-sobha-hartland","display_address":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Ellington Properties","price":2050000,"display_price":"2.05M","lattitude":25.1786441,"longitude":55.3083716,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Berkeley Place is a residential complex in Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City), next to Meydan Academy Golf Course and Driving Range and 10 minutes drive from the center of Dubai.</p><p>The complex consists of a first floor with a lobby, two podium levels and 12 residential floors, on which are located apartments with <strong>1 - 2 bedrooms, as well as studios</strong>. The finishing of the premises is made in a light color scheme, which together with large panoramic windows creates a bright and cozy interior. Kitchens are equipped with a kitchen island and built-in cabinets with stylish facades in light color. Open balconies with glass enclosures provide unobstructed views from the panoramic windows of the apartments to the lush green parks of the neighborhood.</p><p>A large landscaped roof level terrace with a luxurious swimming pool and other amenities is available to residents.</p><p>The building has 2 passenger elevators and 1 service elevator. The complex also has a parking lot and charging stations for electric vehicles. The lobby area includes a lounge area with a library, workspace, concierge desk, and a game room with access to an outdoor terrace. Also on the first floor of the building there is bicycle parking, a basketball court and seating areas surrounded by landscaped gardens. The excellent location of the complex allows its residents to enjoy easy access to any part of the city.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/921/images/2024/02/08/W7sBLgVHw7giRNQF1EV20UgAlMzaKNgQtyXRlsnq.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/08/W7sBLgVHw7giRNQF1EV20UgAlMzaKNgQtyXRlsnq.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/921/images/2024/02/08/uajjlZ1nkQWVWXbveDczwqIAo2L53wx4KGLcG7Nj.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/08/uajjlZ1nkQWVWXbveDczwqIAo2L53wx4KGLcG7Nj.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/921/images/2024/02/08/GGOHRmbAgJfGs4Yauo8HBrEr5yaV1eOVFFlLSiY6.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/08/GGOHRmbAgJfGs4Yauo8HBrEr5yaV1eOVFFlLSiY6.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/921/images/2024/02/08/PvBr0BRGwSYzrwPXDXIBw63UfdXJdTJLRpQKGirb.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/08/PvBr0BRGwSYzrwPXDXIBw63UfdXJdTJLRpQKGirb.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2753,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/08/ZjUTAp5GD5XwgcAEMeT9HygiJBcsvfNHuZ9ycB5x.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":971,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1544,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1545,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1546,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"floori